     1,
     "Hello everyone,<div>I am new to CamtrapR and I have already created my station folders manually. Unfortunately, the date and time in one of my cameras was not set correctly. Now i would like to use the time shift function but I can&#39;t get it to work. Is it possible to use manually created station folders or do I have to use the create station folders function first? If I can use my own paths how do I have to adjust the code? I tried creating an object by replacing the &quot;pictures/sample_images&quot; directory in the code below with my own directory.  </div><div><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit;font-size:inherit;white-space:pre;box-sizing:border-box;border-width:0px;border-style:solid\"><br></span></font></div><div><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit;font-size:inherit;white-space:pre;box-sizing:border-box;border-width:0px;border-style:solid\">wd_images_ID &lt;- system.file(</span><span style=\"font-family:inherit;font-size:inherit;white-space:pre;box-sizing:border-box;border-width:0px;border-style:solid\">&quot;pictures/sample_images&quot;</span><span style=\"font-family:inherit;font-size:inherit;white-space:pre;box-sizing:border-box;border-width:0px;border-style:solid\">, package = </span><span style=\"font-family:inherit;font-size:inherit;white-space:pre;box-sizing:border-box;border-width:0px;border-style:solid\">&quot;camtrapR&quot;</span><span style=\"font-family:inherit;font-size:inherit;white-space:pre;box-sizing:border-box;border-width:0px;border-style:solid\">)<br></span></font></div><div><span style=\"font-family:inherit;font-size:inherit;white-space:pre;color:rgb(171,178,191);box-sizing:border-box;border-width:0px;border-style:solid\"><br></span></div><div><font color=\"#000000\">And then running the:</font></div><div><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;border-width:0px;border-style:solid;font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,Monaco,Consolas,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,&quot;Courier New&quot;,monospace;font-size:0.875em;margin:1.714286em 0px;color:rgb(171,178,191);background:repeat rgb(40,44,52);overflow-x:auto;line-height:1.714286;border-radius:0.375rem;padding:0.5em;display:block\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;border-width:0px;border-style:solid;font-family:inherit;font-size:inherit;border-radius:0px;padding:0px;line-height:inherit;white-space:pre\">timeshift_run &lt;- TimeShiftImages(inDir = wd_images_ID_copy,\r\n  TimeShiftTable = timeShiftTable,\r\n<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;border-width:0px;border-style:solid\">  stationCol = </span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;border-width:0px;border-style:solid;color:rgb(152,195,121)\">&quot;Station&quot;</span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;border-width:0px;border-style:solid\">,\r\n</span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;border-width:0px;border-style:solid\">  hasCameraSubfolders = </span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;border-width:0px;border-style:solid;color:rgb(86,182,194)\">FALSE</span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;border-width:0px;border-style:solid\">,\r\n</span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;border-width:0px;border-style:solid\">  TimeShiftColumn = </span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;border-width:0px;border-style:solid;color:rgb(152,195,121)\">&quot;timeshift&quot;</span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;border-width:0px;border-style:solid\">,\r\n</span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;border-width:0px;border-style:solid\">  TimeShiftSignColumn = </span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;border-width:0px;border-style:solid;color:rgb(152,195,121)\">&quot;sign&quot;</span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;border-width:0px;border-style:solid\">,\r\n</span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;border-width:0px;border-style:solid\">  undo = </span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;border-width:0px;border-style:solid;color:rgb(86,182,194)\">FALSE</span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;border-width:0px;border-style:solid\">\r\n</span></span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family:inherit;font-size:inherit;white-space:pre;color:rgb(171,178,191);box-sizing:border-box;border-width:0px;border-style:solid\"><br></span></div><div><font color=\"#000000\">But creating the object doesn&#39;t work to begin with. R seems also to be disturbed by my directory beginning with a backslash. I would also like to know if spaces within directories are allowed.</font></div><div><font color=\"#000000\"><br></font></div><div><font color=\"#000000\">Thank you,</font></div><div><font color=\"#000000\">Sonja</font></div>"
    ]
