order-style:solid\">  undo = </span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;border-width:0px;border-style:solid;color:rgb(86,182,194)\">FALSE</span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;border-width:0px;border-style:solid\">\r\n</span></span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family:inherit;font-size:inherit;white-space:pre-wrap;color:rgb(171,178,191);box-sizing:border-box;border-width:0px;border-style:solid\"><br></span></div><div><font color=\"#000000\">But creating the object doesn&#39;t work to begin with. R seems also to be disturbed by my directory beginning with a backslash. I would also like to know if spaces within directories are allowed.</font></div><div><font color=\"#000000\"><br></font></div><div><font color=\"#000000\">Thank you,</font></div><div><font color=\"#000000\">Sonja</font></div>\r\n\r\n<p></p></blockquote></div></div></div></div>"
